activity Gather Intelligence
activity Analyze Data
activity Assess Credibility
activity Identify Threats
activity Develop Strategies
activity Implement Countermeasures
activity Monitor Activity
activity Report Findings
activity Review Intelligence
activity Disseminate Information
bind Gather Intelligence: Source Type, Number of Sources
bind Analyze Data: Analysis Technique, Confidence Score
bind Identify Threats: Threat Level, Risk Factor
bind Implement Countermeasures: Cost of Countermeasures, Days to Respond
bind Report Findings: Report Status, Geographic Region
Source Type: Human, Signal, Open Source, Cyber
Threat Level: integer between 1 and 10
Confidence Score: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Report Status: Draft, Review, Final, Disseminated
Number of Sources: integer between 1 and 50
Risk Factor: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Analysis Technique: Link Analysis, Statistical Analysis, Pattern Recognition
Days to Respond: integer between 1 and 365
Cost of Countermeasures: float between 100.0 and 1000000.0
Geographic Region: North America, Europe, Asia, Africa, South America
Init[Gather Intelligence] | |
Response[Gather Intelligence, Analyze Data] | | |
Succession[Analyze Data, Identify Threats] | | |
Precedence[Identify Threats, Develop Strategies] | | |
Chain Precedence[Develop Strategies, Implement Countermeasures] | | |
Chain Response[Implement Countermeasures, Monitor Activity] | | |
Alternate Response[Monitor Activity, Report Findings] | | |
Alternate Precedence[Review Intelligence, Disseminate Information] | | |
End[Disseminate Information] | |
Co-Existence[Gather Intelligence, Analyze Data] | | |
Existence[Review Intelligence] | |